Subject: [PATCH 00880/11362] [outer-loop] Conductor handoff:
 verifier-as-self-improvement-reward MANDATORY priority + disciplines

Surfaces the verifier-as-self-improvement-reward work where the planner reads (known-
issues MANDATORY-NEXT-MILESTONE), so the conductor can continue it while the operator
sleeps. Bakes in the hard-won disciplines: (1) HEADROOM PRECHECK on the training model's
OWN base accuracy per corpus (minicpm_headroom_check_draft.py) -- not another model's
sample-rate (operator-caught); (2) GOLD-CONTROL GATE -- gold-RFT must stay >= base or the
harness is broken (v1 over-fit caught this); (3) ON-POLICY preferred; (4) LoRA not full-FT.
Continuation: if v2 gold-control passes -> on-policy + scale to Qwen3.6-27B; else harness
fix only. Marks the 2026-06-06 verifier-earns-its-place proof substantially done (panel
closed, moat survives). Points at the scoping docs + harness + precheck tool.

